    <description>Trigger:  
Once the SPD case is submitted and the status set to active 

Logic: 

Set the SPD_Acquisition_Date__c field on the SPD record with the current datetime stamp 

Query for all account records with the same Group Policy Number as set on the SPD record. 

With the list of all patients who are under the applicable Group Policy, iterate through each and update SPD_Active_SPD_Ref__c field to point to the newly activated SPD 

Also update the field SPD_is_Active__c to be true for all these accounts.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>FollowupDateValue</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Follow_Up_Type__c}, &apos;Email and Call&apos;), Today()+7, IF(ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Follow_Up_Type__c}, &apos;Email and Call 2nd Attempt&apos;), Today()+14, IF(ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Follow_Up_Type__c}, &apos;Email and Text&apos;), Today()+21, {!$Record.Follows_Up_Date__c})))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>FollowUpTypeFlag</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(ISNEW(),ISCHANGED({!$Record.Follow_Up_Type__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>TodayDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>TODAY()</expression>
    </formulas>
